	(text "USB Impedance: Coplanar Diff Pair @ 90Ω (D+/D-, J1 to U7)\n2D field solver (agrees with the JLCPCB impedance calculator within 1.5%)\nJLCPCB 2-layer FR-4, 1.6mm, 2 layers, Er 4.5\nDielectric 1.51mm/59.4mil, ref B.Cu GND pour + F.Cu GND pour\nCopper 1oz/1.38mil/0.035mm, solder mask 0.4mil (Er 3.8)\nW 12mil/0.3048mm, gap 6mil/0.1524mm, pour isolation 8mil/0.2032mm\nResult: 89.8Ω"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
